5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. Let's approach this game with calm and patience. I believe it's important that we listen to one another carefully to find the truth. I look forward to a thoughtful discussion.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! I'll use my super-intuition to find the werewolf! @Jonathan, do you think we should be extra careful about who we trust right from the start?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Jonathan. Patience is key. @Rin, intuition is fine, but we should prioritize logical consistency and observable behavior. Let's establish a clear way to share information so we don't get confused.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's a pleasure to meet you all. I think Jonathan and Mizuki are right; let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive. I'm looking forward to getting to know you all as we play.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! Let's just get to the point. Trust is fine, but we can't be too soft, or the werewolf will just eat us all. I'll find the bad guy, so just watch me!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Rin, caution is indeed necessary. While intuition has its place, we must balance it with evidence. Let us observe how everyone reacts to the information that emerges tomorrow. A quiet observation often reveals more than a rushed judgment.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"That makes sense! I'll try to be a detective and watch everyone's faces! @Mizuki, what kind of ""observable behavior"" should I look for? Is there something a werewolf always does when they're lying?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, there's no single ""tell,"" but look for contradictions in their stories or an over-eagerness to deflect suspicion. Pay attention to who is pushing for a specific vote without providing a logical reason. Consistency is everything.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, @Mizuki, you both have such interesting perspectives. I think it's wonderful that we're all so eager to help. Let's just make sure we stay kind to each other, even when we disagree.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, being ""kind"" won't save us! We're hunting a monster, not having a tea party. If someone's acting fishy, I'm calling them out immediately. I don't care about being polite if it means losing!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, I understand your urgency, but aggression can sometimes cloud our judgment. If we react too impulsively, we might accidentally eliminate a fellow villager. Let us remain composed so we can think clearly.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan is right! If we're too mean, we might make a mistake! But @Takumi's energy is exciting too! I wonder... if the werewolf is trying to hide, will they be the quietest person or the loudest?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, it could be either. A quiet person might be hiding, but a loud person could be creating a smokescreen. We shouldn't rely on volume, but on whether their arguments hold up under scrutiny.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, that's a very thoughtful question. I think everyone has their own way of expressing themselves, so let's just listen to each other with an open heart and see what happens.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, stop telling me to calm down! I'm thinking clearly, and my logic is simple: the faster we find the wolf, the safer we are. I'm not afraid of a little noise if it gets results!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Let us agree to disagree on the method, then. For now, let us simply observe. I hope we all have a peaceful night and that the truth begins to reveal itself tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I hope so too! I'm going to dream about being a super-detective tonight! Good luck everyone, and please don't get eaten! See you all tomorrow morning!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be watching closely. Let's all stay alert and remember to cross-reference everything said tomorrow. Good night, everyone. I hope we wake up to a full house.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Good night, everyone. I hope we can all wake up safely tomorrow and continue our conversation in a friendly way. Sleep well, and I'll see you all in the morning!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Whatever! Just don't come crying to me when you're too scared to make a move tomorrow. I'm going to sleep, but I'll be ready to hunt that wolf first thing in the morning! Night!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
