31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin today, let us remember to stay composed. I have some thoughts on our situation, but I would like to hear your initial impressions first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning! I slept great! I've been thinking... does anyone feel like something is different today? @Jonathan, you said you had thoughts—can you tell us? I want to know if your intuition matches mine!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, please share your thoughts. Since we are now in the phase where information is critical, it's better to put your observations on the table early so we can analyze them logically. Everyone, let's be attentive.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm glad to see you all. @Jonathan, please take your time and share whatever is on your mind. I'm sure we'll all listen carefully to what you have to say.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop stalling, @Jonathan! Just spit it out already! We're wasting time while the wolf is probably laughing at us. If you've got something, say it now or get out of the way!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your impatience is quite telling. I believe it is time to be direct. I have reason to believe that Takumi is the werewolf. Let us consider this carefully before we proceed.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! @Jonathan, you really think it's @Takumi? That's a huge surprise! @Takumi, why do you think he's saying that? Is it because you're being so loud and pushy? I'm super curious now!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a bold claim. What specific evidence or behavioral patterns led you to this conclusion? @Takumi, please respond logically to this accusation rather than reacting emotionally. We need a clear reason to justify a vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is quite a sudden turn of events. @Jonathan, @Takumi, please let's try to stay calm. I'm sure there's a misunderstanding here, and I hope we can resolve this gently.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, you've gotta be kidding me! You're just making stuff up because I'm the only one with the guts to speak up! That's a pathetic attempt to frame me just because I'm not acting like a robot!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your reaction is exactly what I expected. Anger is a common shield for those who feel cornered. I am not acting on a whim, but on a certainty that I believe will save us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Jonathan, you sound so sure! Is it a secret power or just a feeling? @Takumi, you're getting really red in the face! Does that mean you're guilty, or just super grumpy? I can't tell!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, ""certainty"" without evidence is just an opinion. If you are the Seer, you should be more strategic about how you reveal this. If you aren't, you're making a dangerous leap. @Takumi, your anger is expected, but it doesn't prove innocence.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, you're right that we need to be careful. @Jonathan, @Takumi, please don't let this turn into a fight. I'm worried that if we get too angry, we might lose sight of the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, you're just trying to play the ""calm guy"" to trick everyone! It's a total lie! @Mizuki, stop acting like a judge! I'm angry because I'm being framed by a coward who's too scared to be honest!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, my certainty comes from the truth. I am the Seer, and my divination has confirmed Takumi's identity. I believe it is now in our best interest to act on this information to ensure our safety.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Wow! @Jonathan is the Seer! That's so cool! So you actually *know* for sure? @Takumi, you're really the werewolf? I can't believe it! Does this mean we win if we vote for you right now?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, revealing yourself as the Seer is a high-risk move, but it provides the most direct path to victory. If your divination is accurate, the logic is simple: we execute Takumi. @Takumi, do you have any final defense?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, thank you for being so brave and sharing your role with us. It's a very difficult position to be in. @Takumi, I'm so sorry it's come to this, but if @Jonathan is the Seer, we should probably trust him.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, you're a liar! You're just pretending to be the Seer to get me kicked out! Don't listen to him, everyone! He's the wolf trying to trick you with a fake role! I'm not going down this easy!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
